{
  "name": "Deep Freeze",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The Speed reduction from your Clinging Frost feature increases to 20 feet and subsequent failed Saving Throws against it have additional effects as per below:</p><ul><li><strong>One failed save:</strong> The affected creature has Disadvantage on its next Attack Roll.</li><li><strong>Two failed save:</strong> The affected creature's Speed is reduced to 0.</li><li><strong>Three failed save:</strong> The affected creature has vulnerability against the damage of the next spell you cast that deals cold damage.</li></ul>",
